# The tests follow the org clang-tidy configuration (_config/.clang-tidy, linked to the root by CI), with one
# exception: the mock and example ports keep their hooks as instance methods, because a port is an object the
# driver calls through (the port contract), even when a mock's hook happens not to touch its state.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >-
  -readability-convert-member-functions-to-static
